      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Currently, the Zenith Tablet is available for pre-order with an estimated stock of 250,000 units. We have an option to increase the number to 500,000 units for the launch, depending on the production capacity confirmed by our manufacturing partners. If we opt for the higher quantity, we should emphasize the scale of the distribution and availability. Conversely, with 250,000 units, we'll highlight its exclusive nature and the hands-on experience with premium service partnerships. Both options should be clearly communicated in the press kit messaging to match the perceived value and the actual supply.",
